Package: crcheck
Title: Checking the Validity and Internal Consistency
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Date: 2024-07-01
Authors@R: 
    person("Qiong", "Chen", , "chenq08@126.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2401-0046", affiliation = "Department of Cancer Epidemiology, The Affiliated\n           Cancer Hospital of Zhengzhou University & Henan Cancer Hospital,\n           Henan Cancer Registry in China"))
Description: Perform internal consistency checks on individual variable or
    combinations of variables collected in cancer registries, in
    accordance with the rules of the International Agency for Research on
    Cancer (IARC) / the International Association of Cancer Registries
    (IACR).
